### Listar
GET http://localhost:8080/tarefas
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar
POST http://localhost:8080/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"titulo": "Estudar Spring", "descricao": "Revisar GET e POST", "concluida": false}

### Buscar por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/tarefas/1

### Filtrar
GET http://localhost:8080/tarefas?titulo=spring

### Atualizar (todos os campos)
PUT http://localhost:8080/tarefas/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"titulo": "Estudar Spring Atualizado", "descricao": "Revisar GET e POST", "concluida": false}

### Excluir
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tarefas/1

### Inválido: 400
POST http://localhost:8080/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Atualização parcial
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tarefas/1/concluida
Content-Type: application/json

{"concluida": true}
